# Copy to `.dev.vars` (ignored by git) for `pnpm run dev:api`. These are secrets of local
# development only; the production ones are set with `wrangler pages secret put`.
# Sign-in (p5-plan.md, M3): the Google client of production (it lists the localhost callback too) and
# the GitHub OAuth App made for localhost, whose callback is
# http://localhost:5173/api/auth/github/callback.
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
# Reports (p5-plan.md, M5; PR 12): Cloudflare's test secret, which always passes.
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=1x0000000000000000000000000000000AA
